1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,460
Classic Litho has publicly demonstrated the ability to produce high-impact work across packaging, retail environments, large-format graphics, and branded physical experiences.

2
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:15,105
That body of work signals more than production capability.

3
00:00:15,105 --> 00:00:21,552
It reflects the discipline required to deliver when quality, consistency, and execution matter.

4
00:00:21,552 --> 00:00:28,631
But when a buyer selects a print and brand-execution partner, they are not simply comparing formats or equipment.

5
00:00:28,631 --> 00:00:32,513
They are deciding who they can trust with an important commercial outcome.

6
00:00:32,513 --> 00:00:44,921
The opportunity is to make Classic Litho’s demonstrated capability easier for the right buyers to understand, value, and choose — beginning with the priorities that matter most to the business today.

7
00:00:44,921 --> 00:00:56,315
EmpathoAI brings more than 20 years of industrial and operational-excellence experience, including environments such as Coca-Cola and Nestlé, to commercial growth challenges.

8
00:00:56,315 --> 00:01:01,657
We do not start by prescribing marketing activity, technology, or automation.

9
00:01:01,657 --> 00:01:12,052
We start by identifying the real constraint, reducing friction and waste, and designing a practical path from proven capability to measurable commercial progress.

10
00:01:12,052 --> 00:01:24,671
Before proposing anything, we would value a 30-minute conversation to understand Classic Litho’s current priorities, the opportunities worth pursuing, and whether EmpathoAI can genuinely contribute.

